  "limitations": [
    "**Synthetic data only.** SYN-001 is ideal, three-component, azeotrope-free, with composition-independent `K`. Nothing here validates an inverse specification against real chemistry, plant data or another simulator. Real-chemistry columns need a liquid-capable property method (out of scope).",
